   "reason": "Same rescue on the other one-charge queen: an eaten Duchess comes back with her clock as it stood, and Rookie's move, tempo and charges are untouched. | Boulder needs no movement and King form needs no safety, so Rookie can stand in the middle of the guard set, immune, and spend turns bricking the pen shut — the only real cost is the move limit.",
